Package: pax
Type: Package
Title: Install R Packages from URLs
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("pedrobtz", email = "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Install R source packages directly from a URL pointing at a
    '.tar.gz' archive, resolving and installing missing dependencies from the
    configured repositories. Implemented using only the packages that ship
    with R itself.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: utils
URL: https://github.com/pedrobtz/pax
BugReports: https://github.com/pedrobtz/pax/issues
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
